    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>38688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>迷える子イルカよ。
告白なさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you dolphins have lost your way, confess to me your sins.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>38948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレがバラバラにしちゃった
&lt;Kohaku&gt;のスピルーンは
必ず取り戻します！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I may have shattered &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s Spirune, but I swear I'll get it back in one piece!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>39192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>気がつくと、&lt;Kohaku&gt;の
足ばかり見ちゃってます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I always find myself staring at &lt;Kohaku&gt;'s legs...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>39436</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;のゴーグルを
勝手にかけて、うっかり
傷をつけちゃいました……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I borrowed &lt;Hisui&gt;'s goggles without asking and accidentally scratched them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>39624</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えっと
他に告白する事はないです。
…………とりあえず</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm. I don't think I have anything else to confess. For now, at least.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>39908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……おなかがすきました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm hungry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……乱暴なお兄ちゃんで
ゴメンなさい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I feel bad that my brother is so aggressive...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……自分のスピリアが……
よく……わからない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't... even really understand my own Spiria...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>40868</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;を危ねぇ目に
あわせっぱなしだ……
兄貴として情けねぇぜ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I keep putting &lt;Kohaku&gt; in danger. Some big brother I am...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰がなんと言おうが
アイツと&lt;Kohaku&gt;の仲は
認められねぇッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't care what anyone says, I'll never accept &lt;Kohaku&gt; being chummy with that punk!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41356</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そこらの女と
&lt;Kohaku&gt;を比べて
つい優越感に浸っちまいます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't help but compare other girls to &lt;Kohaku&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>告白はこれだけだ……
……今んところは</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's all I got. For now at least.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>41828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ナムナム……
宮廷画家になれますよ〜に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh Winged Whale... Help me become a court painter!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;のシスコンぶりは
ちょっとキモイです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;'s obsession with &lt;Kohaku&gt; kinda creeps me out.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……自分の才能が怖い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm scared of my own genius sometimes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>基本的にボク
ザンゲするような事
してないからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't really do anything I think I need to repent for.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>正直、ソーマの値段は
ボッタクリすぎです♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll admit, I overcharge for my Soma! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……意図的にゆらしてます♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I make them jiggle on purpose. ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ウソばかり
上手になっていきます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just keep getting better at lying and nothing else...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>反省はしても、後悔はしない
……かしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even though I repent, I have no regrets... I suppose?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43796</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分は、主を守るためには
その他一切の被害を考慮しない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I do not consider any collateral damage I cause trying to protect my Master.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……公開不可の情報が多すぎる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I possess far too much information that is strictly classified.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>認識しないうちに
ソーマ腕が商店街の品物を
掴んでいる事がある……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>On occasion, my Soma's arms unconsciously grab merchandise from street vendors...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>現在の告白事項は、以上だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That is all I currently have to confess.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……許しましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You are forgiven, child.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>迷える子イルカよ。
告白なさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you dolphins have lost your way, confess to me your sins.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48280</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう二度と逃げない……
アイツからも！
自分のスピリアからもッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll never run away again... Not from him, or even my own Spiria!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;がポテチに
ミソをつけて食べてるのを見て
ちょっとひいてしまいました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I felt kinda grossed out when I saw &lt;Kohaku&gt; dipping potato chips in miso.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>………………………………
………………………………
………………告白できませんッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>..................................................................................................................I'm too scared to tell her how I feel!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えっと、以上かな？
…………多分</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uhh, I think that's it? Probably.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誓います。どんなに怖くても
どんなに苦しくても……
二度と逃げませんッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I swear, no matter how scary or painful it might be... I'll never run away again!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>蹴りすぎて
ちょっと足が太くなった
気がします……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel like my legs are bulking up a bit from all that kicking...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたし、抱きつきグセが
あるのかも？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I might be a little too huggy at times?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>49916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……告白は　あと三十個くらい
あるけど……とても言えないので
もうやめておきます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel like I have about 30 more things I could confess but... I can't bring myself to say them, so I'll stop here...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50200</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お、溺れた時……
思いっきり、リチアに
抱きついちまいましたッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-When I was drowning... I held onto Lithia for dear life!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50444</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦いの最中だってのに
&lt;Ines&gt;の胸に目がいって
技をとちりました！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm always staring at &lt;Ines&gt;'s chest during battle and totally miss my artes!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺は……俺は……
健全すぎる男子ですッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I... I'm... a wholesome, upstanding guy!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>50876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……俺は健全な男子だぁッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...As wholesome as they come!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実はボク……
字はヘタなんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Honestly... my handwriting is GARBAGE.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51404</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦闘中、&lt;Ines&gt;の顔面に
筆をベチャ〜って
やっちゃいました……わざと。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>During one battle, I hit &lt;Ines&gt; in the face with my brush... on purpose.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>グースの温泉に
子ども料金で入ってしまいました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At Goose's hot springs, I only paid the children's entry fee.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>51884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>特に告白する事なんてないよ。
ボク、基本的にいい子だからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't really have anything to confess. I'm a good little bean.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私……色々サバ読んでます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I lie about my age a lot.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52412</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひんぱんに
呑み過ぎて記憶を失います……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have a habit of drinking too much and forgetting it all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、でも！
お酒だけはやめられませんっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I just can't stop myself from drinking!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……反省はするけど
後悔はしないから！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Even upon reflection, I regret nothing!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分はボケたつもりなのに
スルーされる事が多い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I attempt to make comments for comedic effect, however no one acknowledges them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……正直、リチア様も
味覚だけは細かすぎだと感じる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Truthfully, I think that Master Lithia's palate is too limited.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
