    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バレイアの理想は
人のスピリアが融和する世界です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Velleia's ideal world is one in which everyone's Spirias can live in harmony.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひたすらスピリアをすまし
羽クジラ様に祈りましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let us pray to the Winged Whale with all our Spiria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>至純な祈りの先にのみ
理想世界は開かれるのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Only through pure prayer may the ideal world open to you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたが、もし不純なスピリアを
持っているなら左右のザンゲ室で
告白するとよいでしょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you are bearing an impure Spiria, you are welcome to unburden yourself by using one of our confessionals.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なんという事でしょう。
聖都プランスールが
軍に制圧されたそうです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Unbelievable. The holy city Pransule has been conquered by the military.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この教会にも兵士が押し寄せて
くるかもしれませんが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Soldiers may advance on this church as well...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はここを動きません。
ひたすら至純の祈りを奉げる事が
融和への道なのですから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even then, I shall not be swayed. Through pure prayer may we walk the path of reconciliation...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>祈りはとても大切です……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Prayer is of the utmost importance.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ですがっ！
今は行動する時です!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...However! Now is the time for action!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>助けあい、支えあう想いを
行動で示さなくては！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We must show our desire to support one another through our actions!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
